codex
I found a frontend-switching defect: `(lang ...)` retains both the VM and the shared `:frontend-session` marker. Switching from bundled Python to linked Python after a submission therefore skips linked runtime initialization. It also leaves modules installed through Clojure available to Python without a fresh admission check. The new integration test covers a fresh refusal, but not these transitions.
