- String comparison affects only the guest-install observer. Manifest, publication-artifact, and response comparisons remain structural. No concrete published-name or manifest representation defect is established; the reported Dart equality anomaly remains unexplained.
- The dependency-discharge gap is explicitly recorded for the linker seat in `collab/1791590000000-engineer-c4-i3.findings.md:300`. It contradicts the design’s claim that discharge would independently refuse the mismatch, but predates this slice.
- Seven golden values changed; one-time regeneration is author-reported. No new `:yin.code/*` matching was found. The portable fixture and local-runtime DHT limitation are explicit.

